WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.880
A release identity must cover
the whole evaluated configuration.

00:00:03.954 --> 00:00:08.880
Record the model and prompts,
retrieval snapshots, tool schemas,

00:00:08.920 --> 00:00:13.040
allowed actions and memory rules.
Bind these to the dataset,

00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:17.200
rubric, judge and threshold
versions used in evaluation.

00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:21.520
The manifest and code revision
connect baseline and candidate runs

00:00:21.653 --> 00:00:25.120
to the approving owner.
A material component change

00:00:25.180 --> 00:00:28.320
creates a new candidate
and triggers the relevant checks.
